name: Touch Cursor
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/touch-cursor/icon.svg
version: 1.0.2
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Adds a desktop-style virtual cursor to touch devices, driven by an on-screen pad — click, right-click, hold, and hover anything, with configurable tap/hold gestures, a custom cursor look, and scroll-affordance arrows on draggable menus.
p/html: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/touch-cursor/touch-cursor.html
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/touch-cursor/touch-cursor.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/touch-cursor/touch-cursor.js
